TI  - Semaglutide versus other GLP-1 RAs and cardiovascular risk in obesity-related cancer survivors.
AU  - Abdelgadir Omer
AU  - Hernández-Pérez Jesus Gibran
AU  - Hussain Maryam R
AU  - Mendoza Kenny
AU  - Mian Rabiya K
