TI  - Glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor agonist exposure and malignancy risk in patients with endogenous Cushing's syndrome.
AU  - Dotan Idit
AU  - Shochat Tzipora
AU  - Kushnir Shiri
AU  - Diker-Cohen Talia
